    <bpmn:process id="W_W4766" name="W4766. Rental Regulatory Compliance — LTO/LTFRB, DOLE Driver Fitness, Consumer Act" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Annual compliance review; regulatory change; audit (VS-21/VS-22); incident (W4761)
Frequency: Annual + on change
Volume: 1 compliance program across the rental fleet/operations
Owner: Rental Program / Compliance (VS-22) / Legal (VS-100)
Participants: Compliance (VS-22), Legal (VS-100), LTO/LTFRB, Insurance (VS-26)
Source: workflow W4766 — Rental Regulatory Compliance — LTO/LTFRB, DOLE Driver Fitness, Consumer Act</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4766_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4766_Lane1" name="Compliance">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4766_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4766_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4766_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4766_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4766_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4766_Start3" name="Annual compliance review; regulatory change; audit (VS-21/VS-22); incident (W4761)">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4766_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4766_Task4" name="Maintain the regulatory map for self-haul vehicle rental: LTO motor-vehicle…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Maintain the regulatory map for self-haul vehicle rental: LTO motor-vehicle registration (W4747) + CTPL mandate (RA 4136, W4748); the BuildRight-vs-customer liability structure under the Civil Code + Land Transportation rules; Consumer Act (RA 7394) on rental-disclosure, pricing transparency, and unfair-contract terms (links W469); BIR VAT/e-invoicing on rental revenue (VS-79 W4760); and the distinction from LTFRB cargo-freight licensing (VS-06) — a customer self-drive rental is not a for-hire/freight operation
Responsible (R): Compliance / Legal
Accountable (A): Rental Program Manager / Legal
Duration: Annual + on change</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4766_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4766_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4766_Task5" name="Ensure the rental agreement (W4755), pricing disclosure (W4745/W4760), LDW…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Ensure the rental agreement (W4755), pricing disclosure (W4745/W4760), LDW language (W4757), and telematics consent (W4755/W4767) comply with consumer-protection and contract standards; review annually with Legal; assure via Internal Audit (VS-21 W344 trade-promo/spend or W339 regulatory audit pattern)
Responsible (R): Compliance / Legal / Internal Audit
Accountable (A): Rental Program Manager / Legal
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4766_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4766_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4766_Task6" name="Manage regulator interactions (LTO registration audits, DTI consumer complaints…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Manage regulator interactions (LTO registration audits, DTI consumer complaints W469, BIR rental-revenue scrutiny VS-79), incident regulatory reporting (W4761), and officer personal-liability awareness (registered-owner liability); maintain the records (VS-88)
Responsible (R): Compliance / Legal
Accountable (A): Rental Program Manager / Legal
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4766_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4766_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4766_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4766_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-718 (ensure controlled execution — Incident, Damage, Compliance &amp; Rental Analytics (PA-162.3).) | - CTL-718: rental classified correctly (self-drive, not for-hire freight); agreement/pricing/LDW/consent Legally reviewed annually; assured by Internal Audit
Owner: Rental Program / Compliance (VS-22) / Legal (VS-100)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
