    <bpmn:process id="W_W4767" name="W4767. Rental Data Privacy — License/Image/Telematics Data Governance &amp; DSAR" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Rental launch (privacy-by-design); DSAR/erasure request; periodic privacy review (VS-91)
Frequency: Continuous + per DSAR + annual review
Volume: Every rental (~800–1,200/month) collects license image + selfie + telematics + billing PII; ~10–20 DSARs/year
Owner: Rental Program (joint with DPO VS-91)
Participants: DPO (VS-91), Privacy (VS-91.2), Cyber (VS-27.3), Legal (VS-100.3)
Source: workflow W4767 — Rental Data Privacy — License/Image/Telematics Data Governance &amp; DSAR</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4767_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4767_Lane1" name="Rental Program">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4767_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4767_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4767_Lane2" name="Privacy">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4767_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4767_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4767_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4767_Start4" name="Rental launch (privacy-by-design); DSAR/erasure request; periodic privacy review (VS-91)">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4767_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4767_Task5" name="Govern the personal data the rental program collects: driver-license image + ID…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Govern the personal data the rental program collects: driver-license image + ID selfie (W4754), telematics driving data (W4749), billing/payment data (W4760), and dispute/citation data (W4764/W4765) — classify per VS-91, minimize collection, secure storage (VS-27.3), retention aligned to BIR/legal need (10-yr VS-88 per TRAIN/NIRC Sec. 235) and then purge
Responsible (R): Rental Program / Privacy / Cyber
Accountable (A): DPO / Rental Program Manager
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4767_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4767_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4767_Task6" name="Handle Data Subject Access Requests (DSAR) per RA 10173 (VS-91.2 W271): access…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Handle Data Subject Access Requests (DSAR) per RA 10173 (VS-91.2 W271): access, correction, erasure (where legally permissible — note BIR retention conflicts), and objection; manage telematics-consent withdrawal and the do-not-rent list data minimization; coordinate with the DPO
Responsible (R): Privacy / Rental Program
Accountable (A): DPO
Duration: Per DSAR</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4767_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4767_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4767_Task7" name="Run the breach-response path if rental PII/telematics is compromised (VS-91…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Run the breach-response path if rental PII/telematics is compromised (VS-91 breach notification, NPC 72-hour); DPIA for high-risk processing (telematics + biometric selfie); annual privacy review with the DPO and Cyber (VS-27.3)
Responsible (R): Privacy / Cyber / DPO
Accountable (A): DPO / Rental Program Manager
Duration: On event + annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4767_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4767_End8" name="Complete">
