        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-718 (ensure controlled execution — Incident, Damage, Compliance &amp; Rental Analytics (PA-162.3).) | - CTL-718: data minimized &amp; classified; telematics consent at rental (W4755); secured (VS-27.3); retention per VS-88 then purge; DSAR handled per VS-91.2
Owner: Rental Program (joint with DPO VS-91)</bpmn:text>
