    <bpmn:process id="W_W4768" name="W4768. Rental Revenue, Utilization, Attach-Uplift &amp; Fleet-Performance Analytics" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Monthly/quarterly performance review; annual capex &amp; pricing case (W4745); continuous monitoring
Frequency: Monthly + quarterly + annual
Volume: 1 group analytics view across 200 stores
Owner: Rental Program Manager / Analytics (VS-28)
Participants: Finance (VS-17.4), Store Ops (VS-07), Merchandising (attach), Fleet (VS-06)
Source: workflow W4768 — Rental Revenue, Utilization, Attach-Uplift &amp; Fleet-Performance Analytics</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4768_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4768_Lane1" name="Analytics">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4768_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4768_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4768_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4768_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4768_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4768_Start3" name="Monthly/quarterly performance review; annual capex &amp; pricing case (W4745); continuous…">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4768_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4768_Task4" name="Track the rental P&amp;L and unit economics: rental revenue, fuel recovery, LDW…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Track the rental P&amp;L and unit economics: rental revenue, fuel recovery, LDW income, attach-uplift (incremental large-item basket completed because a vehicle was available), direct costs (depreciation, insurance, maintenance, fuel, telematics, staffing), claim losses (W4762), and net contribution per vehicle/store/region
Responsible (R): Analytics / Finance / Rental Program
Accountable (A): Rental Program Manager / Finance
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4768_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4768_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4768_Task5" name="Track fleet performance: utilization rate, turn-down (lost-rental) rate…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Track fleet performance: utilization rate, turn-down (lost-rental) rate, downtime (W4750), incident/loss rate (W4761/W4762), non-return rate (W4763), citation rate (W4764), dispute/chargeback rate (W4765), and LDW take-rate/loss-ratio (W4757/W4748); benchmark across stores and identify outliers
Responsible (R): Analytics / Rental Program / LP
Accountable (A): Rental Program Manager
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4768_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4768_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4768_Task6" name="Report to leadership quarterly with the attach-uplift/ROI story (the strategic…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Report to leadership quarterly with the attach-uplift/ROI story (the strategic reason the fleet exists), feed the annual fleet-sizing &amp; pricing case (W4745) and rebalancing (W4751) and replacement cycle (W4752); drive continuous improvement (VS-133) on loss/utilization drivers
Responsible (R): Analytics / Rental Program
Accountable (A): COO
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4768_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4768_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4768_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4768_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-718 (ensure controlled execution — Incident, Damage, Compliance &amp; Rental Analytics (PA-162.3).) | - CTL-718: rental P&amp;L + attach-uplift + utilization + loss-rate reported monthly; outcomes feed sizing/pricing/rebalancing/replacement
Owner: Rental Program Manager / Analytics (VS-28)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
